<!DOCTYPE html><html data-dpl-id="dpl_35mpEKcgkAuGc9dje9KhsyirvaBm" lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/23sxpni8z86xe.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1ddg70z30qn04.js"/><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/41b5e_o-w2xun.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1cmnso0jnkwt6.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2-k_577svdq9-.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/turbopack-2l6qdc9b47pt9.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/29nm6-6cbu5hi.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0qhakmkiqdnfs.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1y8h_a22iet8w.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3cfgcjwk9t_lf.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><title>MCPCN — MCP Component Network</title><meta name="description" content="React components and workflow blocks for human-controlled MCP Apps."/><link rel="icon" href="/icon.svg?icon.0-2l4nus4v8l3.svg" sizes="any" type="image/svg+xml"/><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0c0hxoamwjsbw.js" noModule=""></script></head><body><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class="site-nav"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark">M</span>MCPCN</a><nav><a href="/docs">Docs</a><a href="/components">Components</a><a href="/blocks">Blocks</a><a href="/examples">Examples</a><a href="/playground">Playground</a></nav><div class="nav-actions"><a class="button secondary" href="/create">Create</a><a href="https://github.com/alvarovillalbaa/mcpcn-ui" class="button">GitHub</a></div></header><main><span class="eyebrow">trust</span><h1 class="component-heading"><span>Consent</span><span><wbr/>Panel</span></h1><p class="lede">Select current scopes and explicitly acknowledge them before identity-only consent intent; no permission is granted or revoked.</p><div class="filter-row"><span class="pill">Domain component</span><span class="pill">React</span><span class="pill">Validated data</span></div><section class="preview-shell" aria-label="ConsentPanel preview"><div class="mcpcn-stack"><label class="mcpcn-label">Preview theme<select aria-label="Preview theme"><option value="light" selected="">Light</option><option value="dark">Dark</option></select></label><div data-preview-theme="light"><section aria-label="ConsentPanel demonstration" class="mcpcn-stack"><p>Review supplied metadata and values. Requests only update this authored demonstration.</p><label>Report state <select aria-label="Privacy report state"><option value="ready" selected="">Ready</option><option value="loading">Loading</option><option value="empty">Empty</option><option value="error">Error</option></select></label><label>Request response <select aria-label="Privacy request response"><option value="immediate" selected="">Immediate</option><option value="hold">Hold until settled</option><option value="throw">Throw current request</option></select></label><div class="mcpcn-row"><label><input type="checkbox" checked=""/>Callback enabled</label><label><input type="checkbox"/>External busy</label><label><input type="checkbox" checked=""/>Mount component</label><label><input type="checkbox"/>Malformed data</label><label><input type="checkbox" checked=""/>Action available</label><label><input type="checkbox" aria-label="Required scope available" checked=""/>Required scope available</label></div><div class="mcpcn-row"><button type="button">Replace report revision</button><button type="button">Replace supplied content</button><button type="button">Replace callback</button><button type="button">Remove reported count</button><button type="button">Remove supplied actions</button><button type="button" disabled="">Resolve oldest request</button><button type="button" disabled="">Reject oldest request</button></div><section class="mcpcn mcpcn-card mcpcn-pc" role="region" aria-label="Review a current consent request" aria-busy="false"><div class="mcpcn-header"><div class="mcpcn-row mcpcn-between"><h3 class="mcpcn-title">Review a current consent request</h3><span class="mcpcn mcpcn-badge">ready</span></div></div><div class="mcpcn-body mcpcn-stack"><h4>Supplied consent request</h4><p>Recipient: <strong>Authored review service</strong></p><p class="mcpcn-pc-text">Purpose: <!-- -->Review selected authored scopes.</p><p>Reported consent decision: <strong>granted</strong></p><p class="mcpcn-hint">Choose current scopes and acknowledge them before requesting approval. A request does not grant or revoke access.</p><fieldset class="mcpcn-pc-scopes"><legend>Current requested scopes</legend><label><span class="mcpcn-row"><input type="checkbox" aria-label="Select scope: Read authored summary"/><strong>Read authored summary</strong></span><span>Required<!-- -->; <!-- -->Available</span><span class="mcpcn-pc-text">Required for this supplied request.</span></label><label><span class="mcpcn-row"><input type="checkbox" aria-label="Select scope: Read authored notes"/><strong>Read authored notes</strong></span><span>Optional<!-- -->; <!-- -->Available</span></label><label><span class="mcpcn-row"><input type="checkbox" aria-label="Select scope: Export authored records" disabled=""/><strong>Export authored records</strong></span><span>Optional<!-- -->; <!-- -->Unavailable</span></label></fieldset><label class="mcpcn-row"><input type="checkbox" aria-label="Acknowledge current review"/>I reviewed and agree to request approval for the selected current scopes.</label></div><div class="mcpcn-footer mcpcn-row"><button class="mcpcn mcpcn-button" type="button" disabled="">Request consent approval</button><button class="mcpcn mcpcn-button" type="button">Decline consent request</button></div></section><div class="mcpcn-row"><output aria-label="Privacy intent count">0</output><output aria-label="Settled privacy requests">0</output><output aria-label="Pending privacy requests">0</output></div><pre class="mcpcn-code" aria-label="Last privacy intent">No request sent.</pre></section></div></div></section><section class="section prose"><h2>Install</h2><pre class="code">pnpm dlx mcpcn add <!-- -->consent-panel</pre><p>Public npm availability is a separate release gate. The repository documentation records the currently verified source, archives and hosting profile.</p><h2>Data props</h2><p>These fields come from the actual exported schema. Defaults may be omitted on input; the schema below describes validated output. Runtime checks also validate identities, conditional values and safe evidence links.</p><div class="mcpcn-table-wrap"><table class="mcpcn-table"><caption>ConsentPanel<!-- --> data fields</caption><thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>Type</th><th>Input</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><code>id</code></th><td>string</td><td>Required</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>revision</code></th><td>string</td><td>Required</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>title</code></th><td>string</td><td>Required</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>description</code></th><td>string</td><td>Optional</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>state</code></th><td>string</td><td>Required</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>request</code></th><td>object</td><td>Optional</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>approveAction</code></th><td>object</td><td>Optional</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>declineAction</code></th><td>object</td><td>Optional</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><code>message</code></th><td>string</td><td>Optional</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2>React integration</h2><pre class="code">import { ConsentPanel } from &quot;@mcpcn/react&quot;;
import type { ConsentPanelData } from &quot;@mcpcn/schemas&quot;;

const data: ConsentPanelData = {
  &quot;revision&quot;: &quot;1&quot;,
  &quot;state&quot;: &quot;ready&quot;,
  &quot;id&quot;: &quot;consent-1&quot;,
  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Review a current consent request&quot;,
  &quot;approveAction&quot;: {
    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;approve&quot;,
    &quot;revision&quot;: &quot;1&quot;,
    &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Request consent approval&quot;,
    &quot;available&quot;: true
  },
  &quot;declineAction&quot;: {
    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;decline&quot;,
    &quot;revision&quot;: &quot;1&quot;,
    &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Decline consent request&quot;,
    &quot;available&quot;: true
  },
  &quot;request&quot;: {
    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;consent-report&quot;,
    &quot;revision&quot;: &quot;1&quot;,
    &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Supplied consent request&quot;,
    &quot;recipientLabel&quot;: &quot;Authored review service&quot;,
    &quot;purpose&quot;: &quot;Review selected authored scopes.&quot;,
    &quot;reportedDecision&quot;: &quot;granted&quot;,
    &quot;scopes&quot;: [
      {
        &quot;id&quot;: &quot;scope-required&quot;,
        &quot;revision&quot;: &quot;1&quot;,
        &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Read authored summary&quot;,
        &quot;required&quot;: true,
        &quot;available&quot;: true,
        &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Required for this supplied request.&quot;
      },
      {
        &quot;id&quot;: &quot;scope-optional&quot;,
        &quot;revision&quot;: &quot;2&quot;,
        &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Read authored notes&quot;,
        &quot;required&quot;: false,
        &quot;available&quot;: true
      },
      {
        &quot;id&quot;: &quot;scope-unavailable&quot;,
        &quot;revision&quot;: &quot;3&quot;,
        &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Export authored records&quot;,
        &quot;required&quot;: false,
        &quot;available&quot;: false
      }
    ]
  }
};

&lt;ConsentPanel {...data} onAction={intent =&gt; console.log(intent)} /&gt;</pre><section aria-label="Privacy and context integration contract"><h2>Current review and private data</h2><p>Reported access, visibility and consent are supplied claims. A resolved callback does not grant or revoke access, send a context payload or change that report. Approval needs fresh current scopes and acknowledgement; context handoff needs a fresh complete-preview acknowledgement. Replacing the report or callback clears the draft and fences obsolete responses.</p><p>Callbacks contain current component, report and action IDs/revisions, plus approved scope or planned section IDs/revisions. Values, labels, purposes, recipients, counts and exclusion reasons stay outside those intents. JSON regions expose every supplied value for keyboard reading; zero, false, null and absent counts stay distinct.</p><p>Server-only and excluded entries accept metadata only. Keep actual server-only values out of the client payload. Visibility labels and catalogue security declarations do not enforce isolation. The structured-result helper includes its supplied data without automatic redaction; never place private review values in model-visible structuredContent or content.</p><p>The server example prepares separate model-safe metadata and a private app payload. Route the private payload through your host&#x27;s approved private app channel and enforce authorization before any operation. This preparation does not send data, register a tool or configure a host policy.</p></section><p><code>className</code> styles the surface and <code>onAction</code> receives consumer-owned intent. The new domain controls and revised approval/form surfaces expose <code>busy</code> and <code>error</code> feedback. Controlled selections and answers must be acknowledged by updating their props.</p><h2>Events</h2><p>This surface displays data and has no dedicated domain event contract.</p><h2>JSON Schema</h2><pre class="code" a